  "published": "2026-08-29T19:14:29.75Z",
  "readmeFile": "README.md",
  "releaseNotes": "v1.4.2: final chdman parity — LZMA raw-encode work-buffer replication (MAME 1 MiB ring, stale-slot bytes and SHA-1 hash-order), createhd size/CHS quirks (sscanf %I64u leading digits, guess_chs round-up), laserdisc AVI byte-parity, strict info/verify option validation, DVD metadata single-NUL payload, CLI exit codes; battle harness 2907/2907 vs MAME 0.289. Pure C# — zero native dependencies. Targets net8.0/net9.0/net10.0.",
